otherwise known as agent 13 sharon  carter is one of shield's deadliest  operatives  but what's the full story behind this  legendary ally of captain america  from her family roots to her most  dangerous missions this is the untold  truth of sharon carter  one thing worth knowing is that sharon  carter wasn't actually the first  agent 13. her aunt margaret peggy carter  holds that distinction  during her time as agent 13 peggy fights  in the french resistance  falls in love with captain america and  takes on the first iteration of hydra  naturally peggy is heartbroken when cap  disappears  however she quickly overcomes her grief  joins a number of different spy agencies  and eventually becomes an  agent of shield her older brother  harrison later welcomes a daughter named  sharon  and the two become very close in fact  sharon sees peggy as something of a  personal hero  having grown up dazzled by tales of her  aunt's wartime exploits sharon decides  to join shield  and even adopts her aunt's old code name  but then  peggy suddenly relapses into grief for  cap and is placed  into an asylum she becomes so delusional  in fact that she imagined sharon to be  her kid sister and harrison to be her  father  this strange plotline was introduced  mostly because of the increasing time  lag between world war  ii and the modern era in the end it  turns out that peggy is being  manipulated by dr faustus  but cap rescues her and she snaps out of  her delirium  cap finally convinces peggy that they  can never be together  although he conveniently leaves out the  part about him dating sharon  when captain america first meets sharon  carter she looks so much like peggy that  he actually thinks he's hallucinating  at the time sharon is on a mission for  shield trying to prevent batroc the  leaper from obtaining a chemical  compound called inferno 42.  they later reunite while trying to take  down aim and modoc  soon after she helps cap and black  panther bring down baron zemo after the  notorious villain obtains a death ray  and these are just a small handful of  agent 13's adventures in the silver age  of comics  sharon works frequently with steve  rogers during this era but  cap never fully embraces her as a  partner unfortunately he's always too  worried about her personal safety to  realize how lethal  and useful she can be it doesn't help  that he's  also kinda obsessed with bucky's death  at this point and  can't stand the thought of losing  another partner both captain america  and sharon carter flirt with retirement  on multiple occasions  always in the hope that they might  settle down together  cap is the first to consider this when  they're reunited for the first time  heck he even makes plans to propose to  her when he realizes he's about to be  replaced by a bunch of cosplayers  however he realizes that he can't hang  up the shield just yet  nonetheless cap tries to get sharon to  quit on multiple occasions  at first she's resistant to the idea but  she eventually agrees to take an  inactive role with shield that places  her firmly on the sidelines  later sharon regains her full-time role  with shield as nick fury claims her phd  and metaphysical psychology makes her  too valuable and agent to lose  sharon is subsequently put in charge of  an all-woman cadre of shield agents  called the femme  force there is a brief time during which  sharon decides she's had enough of  shield  and finally quits to be with cap not  long after however cap defeats the  secret empire and learns that it's  headed by a  high-ranking government official he's so  disillusioned by this revelation that he  quits his role as captain america  and when hawkeye talks stephen to  becoming a new kind of hero  sharon is less than enthused by the idea  you didn't see that coming ultimately  cap's decision to walk the hero's path  puts an end to his dreams of living an  idyllic life with sharon  even by the standards of the marvel  universe dr faustus  is a truly vile villain his entire modus  operandi is violating people's free will  to make them his mind slaves and the  subtle nature of his powers make him  especially difficult to root out and  destroy he manipulates peggy carter for  years  although he never learns anything of  much use  then william burnside the twisted  captain america of the 1950s comes under  his control  compelling him to become the leader of a  neo-nazi group  called the national force at this point  cap and sharon have been on again off  again for a long time  she's still mad at him for choosing life  as captain america over her and is busy  flirting with her neighbor the pacifist  dave cox sharon soon returns to active  duty and  ends up acting as a shield liaison for  the new york police during their  investigation of the national force  when she goes undercover however she  quickly comes under the influence of  faustus who makes her one of his foot  soldiers  during a battle against the national  force cap loses sight of sharon who is  later revealed to have self-immolated  alongside a number of  other national force agents for all  intents and purposes  sharon carter is dead except of course  she  isn't what a twist  it's eventually revealed that sharon has  actually been sent on a deep cover  mission in europe but  something went wrong along the way she  got completely cut off from shield and  ended up behind  enemy lines and it took her years to  make it out with captain america  convinced that she was dead the whole  time  now at this point in comics canon the  super soldier serum has begun to take a  toll on cap's body  just as he's about to die sharon and her  team whisk away his body and give him a  total blood transfusion from the only  other person with the serum running  through their veins  the red skull as it turns out the red  skull who has been inhabiting a clone of  cap's body for years  arranged the rescue because he needs the  real cap to retrieve the cosmic cube  the cube is being held by a group of  fanatics from aim called the kuba cult  a group sharon has successfully  infiltrated she puts the cube in cap's  hands knowing he'll use its power for  good but  cap gets trapped inside it with adolf  hitler of all people  of course he soon triumphs escapes and  defeats the red skull  cap and sharon are reunited and their  on-again off-again relationship is  finally turned back on  after the civil war conflict between  steve rogers and tony stark turns deadly  captain america decides to end the  bloodshed by turning himself  in on his way to his trial however he's  gunned down  by a mysterious sniper shortly after the  news of cap's death goes public  cynthia sin schmidt daughter of the red  skull corners a frantic sharon in a  hospital bathroom  she then tells sharon that dr faustus  has a message for her  remember sharon realizes to her horror  that she has killed captain america it  turns out that this whole mess has been  part of an elaborate brainwashing scheme  perpetrated by the red skull and dr  faustus  who installed a subconscious trigger in  sharon's mind  and used her to seemingly kill cap  thankfully it turns out that cap was  merely displaced in time so sharon  enlists the aid of him  and reed richards to bring him back to  reality  after captain america returns from his  time travel pseudo death  he and sharon become closer than ever  subsequently she joins his secret  avengers black  ops team and alongside a number of other  heroes they chase the serpent crown to  mars  battle the shadow council and uncover  the thule society a secret order of  nazis  then when peggy carter finally dies of  old age sharon capp and their allies  come together to mourn her passing  at the funeral however a sniper starts  shooting at them and they quickly learn  that the assailant is the world war ii  hero code named bravo  bravo was lost on an extra dimensional  mission eventually returning and  aligning himself with a new version of  hydra  cap is subsequently trapped in the  extra-dimensional land of nowhere but  sharon  alongside fury and the falcon steps up  to rescue him  one of the weirdest cap stories ever  begins when a mysterious subway car  arrives at an abandoned station in new  york  cap climbs on board but sharon doesn't  as it only has room for one  thus cap is whisked away to the brutal  dimension z an  alien reality that has been conquered by  cap's old enemy arnhem zola  zola seeks to remove the super soldier  serum from cap  in order to give it to his children cap  spends the next dozen years trying to  survive  even raising zola's son ian as his own  he creates an alliance with a local  tribe of monsters opposed to zola and  eventually leads a rebellion  against the villain sharon manages to  track him down too  as only 30 minutes have passed on earth  though zola's daughter jet black  switches sides to join the heroes  sharon is forced to sacrifice herself to  save cap  and the earth predictably however sharon  isn't actually dead  having arrived in dimension z sharon  takes over cap's role and raises ian as  her own  when she is finally rescued from  dimension z by the falcon  she and steve reunite for a while they  find peace and happiness together as  they coordinate the avengers but  generally refrain from going on field  missions  sharon has acted as director of shield  on a couple of different occasions  the first of these happens after she  embarks on an expedition into the savage  land with captain america  as their mission comes to an end a  tender moment between the two lovebirds  is crashed by nick fury who later  reveals that he's decided to appoint  sharon  as his replacement years later when cap  is replaced by the cosmic cube generated  hydra cap it's revealed that the red  skull was behind shield's initiative to  use a partial cosmic cube to create the  super villain town of pleasant hill  the red skull knew that the experiment  was doomed to failure however and even  allowed baron zemo to come in  and wreck it for good measure this was  the former shield director maria hill's  project  and as such she takes the fall for it  evil cap then pushes to have sharon take  the role of director  instead sharon recommends him for the  job with a proviso that gives him  absolute power in case of emergency it  doesn't end well  hey elijah  the secret empire event sees sharon step  down as shield director because she  thinks steve rogers is the right man for  the job  unfortunately for her and everyone else  a young sentient cosmic cube  named kobik has been brainwashed by the  red skull rewriting reality such that  steve rogers has always been a  deep cover hydra agent steve secretly  organizes an alien attack on new york  creating a state of emergency during  which he is awarded total control of  all armed forces evil cap is still in  love with sharon however  and gives her special treatment in his  new regime  he tries whining and dining her then  takes her out to a hydra youth science  fair where they see kids work on  surveillance equipment for hunting down  inhumans  when evil cap survives an assassination  attempt by black widow and starts to  doubt himself  he turns to sharon for reassurance  instead she almost dabs him  in the throat with a wooden stake  feeling a little peeved by this turn of  events cap puts sharon in prison and has  dr faustus brainwash her  unbeknownst to faustus however sharon  has studied his voice and techniques  and is now immune to them she poisons  him  knocks him out and uses cap's password  to bring down his  strike fleet helping to bring an end to  the hydra's reign and  ushering in the return of the real  captain america  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite shows are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one
 

